WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
That's why the United States is now applying tariffs

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.200
to other countries,

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.520
and much as these tariffs were, for many years, applied to us,

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.320
uncontrollably applied to us,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.960
we've used tariffs as a defense mechanism

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.480
under the Trump administration,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.280
including my first term where hundreds of billions of dollars

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.040
in tariffs were taken in.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.680
And by the way, we had the lowest inflation,

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.840
and now we have very low inflation.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.320
The only thing different is that we have hundreds of billions

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.920
of dollars flowing into our country.

